# A record whose TypeId this build does not know. Task 1.2.5.
#
# `core-type-system` requires that such data be "preserved verbatim as an opaque blob so re-saving
# does not destroy it". peek_record() reads its header without the type, and write_opaque() copies
# it forward byte for byte.

